  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 establishes the pads and large-surfaces contract: CursesPad, destructive viewport projection, independently pannable CursesPadViewport state, shared derived views through CursesWindow subwindows, independent visible-pad change observation, strict resize revalidation, large-surface acceptance, package-only coverage, and pad-only opt-in revision tracking so ordinary logical screens retain their pre-0.5 memory profile. Dependencies remain Icod.Terminal 1.0.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
